// # Cyber-Physical Digital Twins, Bond Graphs & DAE Solvers Facade
//
// Logline: Unified domain facade re-exporting bond graph modeling, multi-physics DAE solvers, HIL simulation, and asset state assimilation.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and master entry point importing all 49 companion submodules for openOODA cyber-physical digital twin callers.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular bond graph, DAE solver, real-time HIL emulator, and surrogate twin subcomponents.
//   2. Re-export public constructors, state-space integrators, Kalman observers, and degradation models.
//   3. Maintain full interoperability across industrial cyber-physical digital twin pipelines.

